// Speech cancellations by reason and error code (DIAAT-284; events from OBS-4:
// DIAAT-278 / DIAAT-300), over the time range.
//
// Run against the environment's Application Insights resource (customEvents; one per
// environment, no environment split). No parameters: the time range comes from the caller.
//
// Sources (browser, transcribe-web lib/dictation-session.ts, relayed by transcribe-api's
// POST /api/telemetry):
//   "speech.canceled"  - the Azure Speech SDK canceled event: speech.cancel_reason
//                        (Error, EndOfStream, CancelledByUser, StartFailed, Unknown) and
//                        speech.error_code (SDK CancellationErrorCode, e.g. ConnectionFailure,
//                        AuthenticationFailure, TooManyRequests, ServiceTimeout).
//   "speech.unhealthy" - Speech sessions collapsing repeatedly (dictation.collapses_in_window
//                        in dictation.window_seconds); it fails the dictation session with
//                        "speech.unhealthy".
// Area: dictation only (DIAAT-205, decision 1). Relayed browser events carry no hmcts.area,
// so the area comes from the journey type's prefix ("dictation.session" -> "dictation").
// Formula, per event, reason and error code:
//   events   = number of events
//   sessions = distinct dictation sessions affected (hmcts.journey.id; dcount, ~1% error)
// Caveats: EndOfStream and CancelledByUser are usually benign; Error with an error code is
// the Speech failure signal. Browser loss makes counts a lower bound.
customEvents
| where name in ("speech.canceled", "speech.unhealthy")
| extend area = coalesce(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.area"]),
    tostring(split(tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.type"]), ".")[0]))
| where area == "dictation"
| extend reason = tostring(customDimensions["speech.cancel_reason"]),
    error_code = tostring(customDimensions["speech.error_code"]),
    journey_id = tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.journey.id"])
| summarize events = sum(itemCount), sessions = dcount(journey_id), last_seen = max(timestamp)
    by event = name, reason, error_code
| order by events desc
